  (RsOk l3 c0 (MkRq 2 Lo (BTrue) Ro) (rch-run l3 c0 _ _ e _ t ch dc run (MkDc 2 Lo Ro (BTrue) (bits "00" x3) ro dLo dRo))))

(def-fns _ $ (many c-chain : (erased (Conf) c0) (many (Rq) e) (erased (Rch l3 c0 e) ch) -> (many (Rs l3 c0) res))
